## Summary
The article describes meetings between Ligurian Governor Giovanni Toti and entrepreneur Beppe Spinelli on a yacht, where Toti plans to visit Spinelli before elections to discuss certain matters. Spinelli comments that at 83 years old, he is immune to repercussions. The encounters are documented with images, suggesting political implications.

## Key Points
- Governor Toti met Spinelli on a yacht to discuss pre-election issues.
- Spinelli, aged 83, expressed that he cannot be harmed due to his age.
- The meetings hint at potential political lobbying or favor requests.
- Images of the yacht encounters are publicly available, indicating scrutiny.


